                        D -->|No/Stylized| F[Eevee Works Great]
                        C --> G{Complex Glass/Caustics?}
                        G -->|Yes| H[Consider Cycles<br/>or simplify]
                        G -->|No| I[Eevee Perfect Choice]
                        E --> J{Time Available?}
                        J -->|Limited| K[Start with Eevee<br/>Final in Cycles]
                        J -->|Plenty| L[Use Cycles]
                        
                        style C fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
