                            <li>Light paths and bounces</li>
                            <li>Caustics and complex light effects</li>
                            <li>GPU vs CPU rendering</li>
                            <li>Optimization techniques for faster Cycles renders</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>Get ready to create photorealistic masterpieces!</p>
                    </div>

